28  dist/C3dMcp-2027-0.10.0.zip
-------------------------------
Added
  - A versioned installer with the rebuilt server, Civil 3D 2027 add-in,
    installer scripts, and guides.
Removed
  - Temporary staging files used for building and packaging.
Modified
  - New release archive.
Why
  - Deliver the updated add-in and MCP server together while leaving the running
    0.9.0 session in place.

Verification
------------
  - Built the Civil 3D 2027 add-in with zero warnings and zero errors.
  - Passed the standard, split, and read-only MCP smoke suite.
  - Compiled and tested the C# request tracker with a concurrent duplicate,
    completed replay, changed payload, mismatched drawing, and recorded error.
  - Passed seven offline SewerGEMS regressions. The supplied export with 50
    manholes and 50 conduits passed validation.
  - Verified the archive contents against the build inputs and tested the ZIP's
    packaged server against a temporary bridge.
  - The live Civil 3D session was running 0.9.0 with a project drawing open.
    The 0.10.0 edits and SewerGEMS drawing creation require live verification
    on a scratch drawing with the updated add-in and server.
